        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Penthouse Living Beside the People’s Park\r\n\r\nThere’s city living, and then there’s living above the city.\r\n\r\nSet at penthouse level in Maritana Gate, right beside the People’s Park, this impressive three-bedroom apartment offers something that is seldom found on the Waterford market, genuine space, contemporary living and an elevated outlook across the city, all in one of its most convenient locations.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the sense of light and space is immediately apparent. Expansive glazing draws your eye towards the urban landscape beyond, with views across the rooftops and skyline of Waterford creating an ever-changing backdrop to everyday life.\r\nThe main living and dining area is particularly generous, with plenty of room to relax, entertain and dine without the compromises sometimes associated with apartment living. The contemporary finish complements the clean lines of the space, while the extensive windows ensure the apartment feels bright and open throughout the day.\r\n\r\nFrom here, step outside onto the balcony and the appeal of the penthouse position really comes into its own. It’s your own private outdoor space above the city, perfect for a morning coffee or simply sitting back and taking in the view.\r\n\r\nOne of the real strengths of this apartment is its accommodation. There are three double bedrooms, providing a level of flexibility that is increasingly difficult to find in the city apartment market. Whether all three are needed as bedrooms or one becomes a home office, guest room or additional living space, there is room here for the apartment to adapt to how you want to live. Two bathrooms add further practicality for both everyday living and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nAnd then there’s the location.\r\nWith the People’s Park next door, one of Waterford’s best-loved green spaces effectively becomes an extension of your neighbourhood. Step outside for a walk through the park, head into the city for coffee, dinner or shopping, or simply enjoy having so much of Waterford within easy reach of home.\r\nIt’s a location that allows you to enjoy the convenience and energy of city life while still having greenery and open space right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFor someone who loves the idea of apartment living but doesn’t want to compromise on bedrooms, living space or outdoor space, Maritana Gate offers a very different proposition.\r\n\r\nWe are advised that the current annual service charge is in the region of €1,990 per annum. Residents’ parking is available within the private car park, and we are advised that the current cost is approximately €70 per month. The building is served by an elevator, providing convenient access to penthouse level.\r\n\r\nThree double bedrooms. Two bathrooms. A private balcony. The People’s Park next door and Waterford spread out in front of you.\r\n\r\nThis is penthouse living from a completely different perspective.\r\n\r\n***Liberty Blue Estate Agents and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied upon as a representation of fact. Subject to contract. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must satisfy themselves as to the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only.***"
